+- Replay executes the ENGINE, never the minds: model outputs are journaled as history (model identity/version, prompt hash, input references, proposal, validator decision, seed, outcome, world-state delta). Replay never re-infers. Raw prompts live in an encrypted, Guardian-custodied deliberation store outside the journal under AA7 scrub — private deliberation is not world-truth, and AA7 deletion never compromises replay.
